- **fors** - FORS sign/verify with fors_gen_leafx1, message_to_indices
- **utilsx1** - wots_treehashx1, fors_treehashx1 (Merkle tree building)
- **merkle** - merkle_sign, merkle_gen_root
- **sign** - crypto_sign_keypair, crypto_sign, crypto_sign_open, crypto_sign_verify
- **rng** - AES-256-CTR-DRBG (using OpenSSL for AES-256-ECB)
- **KAT transcript** - HARAKA_TR variant with haraka sponge-based transcript hashing
- **main** - Exact reproduction of PQCgenKAT_sign.c main loop

